MEMO
To:
Honorable Mayor Patrick Collins and Members of the City Council
From:
Seth Lloyd, Planner II
Subject: PLN-22-00010 / Cheyenne Area Future Land Use & Transportation Map
Amendment for High Plains Business Park

Date:
October 10, 2022

Background:
The item for consideration is a Cheyenne Area Future Land Use & Transportation Map
Amendment. This is approved by Resolution.

The proposed Governing Body review schedule is as follows:
•
Introduction and Referral 10/10/2022
•
Public Services Committee 10/18/2022
•
Final Consideration 10/24/2022

Related Items:
•
UDC-22-00310:  Annexation
•
UDC-22-00313:  Zoning Map Amendment
•
UDC-22-00312:  Final Plat

Planning Commission Recommendation:
The Planning Commission heard this item at their October 3, 2022 meeting and unanimously
recommended the Governing Body approve this application.

Board of County Commissioners Recommendation:
The item will go before the Board of County Commissioners on October 18. Staff will provide a memo
regarding the Board of County Commissioners action on the item (if any) prior to final consideration of
this item on 10/24/2022.

The Planning Commission Staff report is attached and has not been changed (less the draft Planning
Commission Resolution, instead, the signed Planning Commission Resolution adopting this action is
attached).

Attachments:
1. Resolution
2. Planning Commission Staff Report (including the signed Planning Commission Resolution)

