NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING:

THAT, the City of Cheyenne Governing Body hereby certifies Planning Commission
action amending the Cheyenne Area Future Land Use & Transportation Map of Connect 2045:
Update to the Master Transportation and Future Land Use Plan of PlanCheyenne changing the
land use category from Urban Residential and Mixed Use Residential to Mixed Use Employment
