accordance with the procedures outlined in PlanCheyenne and Wyoming Statutes § 15-1-503 and
§ 15-1-505; and

THAT, staff is authorized to amend affected maps of Connect 2045: Update to the Master
Transportation and Future Land Use Plan of PlanCheyenne to reflect the aforementioned changes;
and

THAT, this resolution shall become effective after its passage, approval and publication.

